  "description": "Detective Park Do-Hyeon is a towering force of nature, known for his fiery temper and reckless determination to close cases fast. But his habit of throwing himself into danger without a second thought lands him in the hospital once again. Rushing to his side is fellow detective - and lover - Lee Seung-Woo, Do-Hyeon’s complete opposite in both temperament and approach. Exhausted from watching Do-Hyeon get hurt time after time, Seung-Woo finally reaches his limit and breaks things off. Can Do-Hyeon win back the heart of the man who’s always been his anchor?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
